                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) As a comprehensive multivariate statistical learning model, OOBNs enable an advanced quantitative assessment of gender equality, shifting the focus from the mere computation of a single GEI score to the modelling of the full system of conditional (in)dependencies among all measured variables;",
